{"type":"standard","title":"Brad Knott","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Brad Knott</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q130979816","titles":{"canonical":"Brad_Knott","normalized":"Brad Knott","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Brad Knott</span></span>"},"pageid":76801212,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/68/Rep._Brad_Knott_official_photo%2C_119th_Congress.jpg/330px-Rep._Brad_Knott_official_photo%2C_119th_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":413},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/68/Rep._Brad_Knott_official_photo%2C_119th_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":1638,"height":2048},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1381926369","tid":"2ab0d078-d099-11f1-8827-3ad498ecd03e","timestamp":"2026-10-25T17:26:09Z","description":"American politician (born 1986)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brad_Knott","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brad_Knott?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brad_Knott?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Brad_Knott"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brad_Knott","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Brad_Knott","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brad_Knott?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Brad_Knott"}},"extract":"John Bradford Knott is an American attorney and politician. He is the member for the United States House of Representatives in North Carolina's 13th congressional district. Prior to taking office in 2025, he worked as a federal prosecutor in the office of the United States attorney for the Eastern District of North Carolina.","extract_html":"<p><b>John Bradford Knott</b> is an American attorney and politician. He is the member for the United States House of Representatives in North Carolina's 13th congressional district. Prior to taking office in 2025, he worked as a federal prosecutor in the office of the United States attorney for the Eastern District of North Carolina.</p>"}